(Pursat): People's houses floating on the water were almost completely engulfed in fire, but did not cause any injuries, so it is presumed that the gas canister exploded.
This incident happened at 9:41 pm on March 11, 2020 in the first village, Kampong Luong commune, Krakor district, Pursat province.
The source added that the house, which was almost completely burnt down, was floating on water, the walls of the corrugated iron pillars were 8 meters by 5 meters, and about 80 percent of the material was damaged. With the intervention of nearby residents, the fire was completely extinguished at 10:20 pm on the same day, but did not cause any casualties.
