(Sihanoukville): Under the guidance of Mr. Phan Oun, Director General of the General Department of CamControl, Ministry of Commerce, Camcontrol branches in all branches throughout the country continue the campaign to strengthen the quality and safety control of products everywhere to contribute. On protecting food safety to the people.
