At the second rice seed promotion forum in Prey Veng province, Mr. Sak Choeun, the national consultant of the Rice Seed Production and Promotion Project, said that the implementation of the project under the cooperation between the Ministry of Agriculture and Jica Implemented so far is to promote the production of good quality rice seeds and use more good seeds.
Mr. Sak Choeun explained to all the participants about the system of management and certification of Cambodian seed quality, called QDS, which is an important system in ensuring that the rice seed produced is a good seed. By quality.
He said that the QDS system is in the process of selecting seeds to ensure good quality before being released to the market through the standardization in the field to reach the final stage is the standardization in the laboratory. . At the same time, in the past, under the practice in Prey Veng province, it has not yet achieved good results in producing rice seeds that have passed the laboratory standard, with some challenges that need to be improved.
Please be reminded that this QDS system will be implemented in the four target provinces of the rice seed quality promotion project, which will be piloted in Prey Veng province and will be implemented in Takeo, Kampong Chhnang and Battambang provinces.
