(Phnom Penh): In response to the call of the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia, with the Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Economy and Finance as the Chairman of the Board of Governors, a series of ministries and institutions, including private companies, have established mechanisms to support the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia through Raise donations from leaders, officials or staff according to their ability.
In fact, on March 9, 2020, the Ministry of Cults and Religions raised a total donation of 5,224,000 Riels (approximately 1,200 USD) and 525 USD for the third time and contributed to bring a smile to Cambodian children since the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia was officially launched on April 11, 2018.
The Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia would like to thank all the leaders and officials of the Ministry of Cults and Religions for initiating a regular mechanism to support the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia to provide financial support to the operation of Kantha Bopha Hospital. Based on the concept of "Khmer help Khmer".
