(Kampong Chhnang): Provincial and municipal authorities are very concerned about the safety of people living in dilapidated buildings in the market under the river in Kampong Chhnang, they refused to leave the building.
Mr. Ly Sophea, Director of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Department of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs, stated that for more than two years, our team has informed the people living in this dilapidated apartment building to leave immediately to avoid The collapse of this building, but to this day, they still live without fear.
It should be reminded that on April 30, 2018, a joint working group at the provincial level led by the Provincial Department of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs published a notification on inspecting and evaluating the quality of construction of 13 residential buildings. Twelve families in Phsar Chhnang village, Sangkat Phsar Chhnang, Kampong Chhnang city to all homeowners to make sure they join the team to solve this problem before the accident.
The working group includes the territorial department, provincial authorities, municipalities, sangkats and villages, as well as local police authorities, but so far they still refuse to leave, which worries our authorities.
