(Phnom Penh): Tycoon Ly Hour, President of the Cambodian Housing Developers Association, on March 10, 2020, issued a letter of support for the Ministry of Economy and Finance's appeal to property owners to request a number of concessions. Any reasonable price or discount for the sale of housing to workers affected by the suspension.
