1: Incentives for all, with special housing discounts of up to 7% for each project of a company that is a member of the Cambodian Housing Developers Association.
2: Encourage general customers who buy a house from March 2020 onwards by paying in full with the Cambodian Housing Developers Company may reduce the special housing price up to 7% more for each project.
