Analysts: Together to implement measures taken by the Royal Government of Cambodia to combat the Kovid 19 crisis
Public disclosure of patient identities not only damages individuals' reputations, but also causes patients and their families to suffer emotional and discrimination.
Can the people join the Royal Government in the fight against Kovid 19?
First, stop the excessive fear that leads to unrest, cause social unrest and provide opportunities for the unscrupulous to take subversion against Cambodia. Opposition groups have sought to distort information about the 19-year-old Kovid virus in order to incite people to panic, to lose control and to create a new era.
Second, all citizens must participate in the fight against false information by disseminating real information, and before sharing, should check the source of information clearly, and this is to participate in the implementation of the Royal Government measures on the control of Kovid disease. Killing fake information by putting the facts quickly is also part of eliminating the fear that comes from fake information.
Thirdly, people who are traders of consumer goods such as masks, alcohol, hand washing or foodstuffs must adhere to high ethics and virtues, without taking advantage of the people's fears about the transmission of Kovit 19. Doing more than the fear of the people is an immoral act.
Fourth, to prevent the spread of Kovit 19, all people must practice cleaning by cleaning their homes, washing their hands often with soap or alcohol and other gels. Use a work mask or scarf where necessary, and in case of suspicion after any suspicious symptoms, immediately rush to the hospital or health center near you to get tested for Kovit 19.
Fifth, request the competent authorities, especially the prosecutors of all provincial and municipal courts throughout Cambodia, to take strict legal action against those who pollute and spread false information related to Kovid 19. Other countries, such as Thailand, have also cracked down on corrupt people.
Sixth: Commitment to join the Royal Government of Cambodia in the fight against Kovid disease, unite as a whole, prevent the spread of this disease, oppose absolutely pollute society and intimidation by corrupt groups.
In fact, for a long time, the origin of this virus was not known. But now, according to Chinese and Japanese reports, the virus originated in various locations but began to spread rapidly after reaching markets in Wuhan.
In fact, the virus did not originate in China, and according to Japanese and other media reports, "the virus may have originated in the United States."
After collecting genetic samples in China, medical researchers initially showed that the virus did not originate from the seafood market, but from several unknown sources. A new study by Chinese researchers suggests that the new coronavirus could be transmitted from person to person in late November 2019 from a location other than the seafood market in Wuhan.
Chinese medical authorities and intelligence agencies then investigated the source of the virus, collecting nearly 100 genetic samples from 12 countries on four continents to determine the viability and mutation of the virus. During the investigation, they determined that the eruption may have started in November, shortly after the Military Game celebration in Wuhan.
Asahi TV has released scientific evidence for their claim, saying no one could know the cause of death because the United States did not pay attention to the tests or did not show results. Japan tries not to answer questions about whether the virus came about spontaneously or was created by humans and it happened by accident or with some intention behind it.
