China calls for peace talks after North Korea fires three missiles into sea
BEIJING: The Chinese Foreign Ministry has called on all parties concerned to engage in consultations as well as hold talks to achieve peace on the Korean Peninsula. This was released by Reuters on Monday, March 9, 2020.
Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman Geng Shuang made the call at a briefing on Monday, just hours after North Korea test-fired several weapons into the sea. According to the South Korean military on Monday morning, North Korea test-fired three short-range missiles into the East Sea.
(Phnom Penh): About 3,458 students of Vanda Institute, 2,954 females, successfully graduated and received their degrees this morning, March 10, 2020. The graduation ceremony was presided over by Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
The graduating students this morning include associate degree, bachelor and master's degree graduates in the 2018-2019 academic year. The students who received this degree include 30 bachelor students of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, 23 females.
Education is a priority and most important area for Cambodia that the Royal Government has paid close attention to since the country was liberated from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot on January 7, 1979. To promote the development of the education sector, Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, has allowed the wealthy to invest in education.
Vanda Institute is a private higher education institution that is actively involved in the training and development of human resources with wisdom and intelligence to contribute to the development of society.
Dr. Heng Vanda, Director of Vanda Institute, said that Vanda Institute currently has three locations in operation. One in Phnom Penh, one in Siem Reap and one in Battambang.
He added that this shadow of peace has provided enough opportunities for people to live in honor, dignity and happiness through nation-building and development in all fields.
