(Phnom Penh): Dana Tri Cambodia Trading Co., Ltd. on March 08, 2020 organized a gathering of 1,000 outstanding distributors from 25 provinces to show the real success of distributors. N.N.P. products. This meeting is also a great opportunity to exchange new ideas, discuss and share successful business experiences with N.N.P products that are hitting all markets across Cambodia.
