Minister Vong Soth confirmed to the German Embassy that the ministry is currently working on a number of social issues, including the provision of allowances to retired civil servants and veterans, and that the ministry is working to provide support for the poor, especially the poor. Poor people with children under 2 years old can receive additional support from the Royal Government of Cambodia.
In response, Christian Burger, German Ambassador to Cambodia, thanked the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation for its cooperation with Germany in developing the social sector in Cambodia.
