In addition, Mr. Vong Soth said that there are still some issues to be addressed in this work, including the poor who have already received their licenses, but there are some difficulties due to their living in remote areas and limited issues. Identify additional poor people to help them benefit from the Royal Government of Cambodia.
He stated that the identification of the poor is the work of the Ministry of Planning and requires the close participation of local officials at the village and commune levels because they are close to the people can understand the people and also allow People who are really poor can apply as well.
Mr. Vong Soth also stated that these tasks are not easy to solve, but the Ministry will try to fulfill this task to provide the benefits of the Royal Government of Cambodia to all target people more effectively. Kandal province has already set up a team of doctors and rooms for patients if there is a case of Covid-19 infection
