It should be informed that the ghost officer refers to the officers who only have the name waiting to be paid, but there is no official or single officer, but there is a framework in two different ministries and so on. Ghost officials were gradually eliminated after the Royal Government reformed ministries and institutions to strengthen work efficiency and serve the people.
Mr. Youk Bunna said, "Regarding the ghost officials, we have cut off those who have only names and no people come to work. "Now in the system there are real people, real officials coming to work."
He added that the reform of manual payroll by unit to pay by bank is like re-trusting civil servants, that is, a civil servant must have a personal account and when opening an official account must There is a face to open by yourself, so if there is only a name and no face, the official can not open.
Please note that Cambodia has found two cases of Covid-19 virus. The first case was reported to have found a Chinese man in Sihanoukville on January 27, 2020 and treated him until he recovered before being allowed to return home.
The second case was found on March 7, 2020 on the body of a Cambodian man. The man was one of four people working closely with the Japanese infected with the Covid-19 virus, who left Siem Reap for Japan on March 3, 2020 via Vietnam.
The new discovery of Covid-19 in Cambodia comes after the Ministry of Health took the saliva of four suspects in Siem Reap who worked closely with the Japanese man. However, three of the four were not infected, while the health ministry was monitoring them for another 14 days, leaving them in isolation.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that as soon as the Ministry of Health found that a Cambodian man was infected with the coronavirus, the Ministry announced the case with the utmost transparency that a 38-year-old Cambodian man had been infected with Covid-19. Immediately, Samdech also announced the temporary closure of schools in Siem Reap, so far more than 110 schools have been closed and the Angkor Sankranti event has been announced to be suspended.
At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also announced that in this short period in Siem Reap must be careful and the reason why Samdech decided to close the school in the name of Samdech as Prime Minister is to pay attention The strongest are boys and girls who do not know how to protect themselves from this incident.
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia has also announced that the ministry has not yet collected those involved with the Japanese and a Cambodian nephew, although the Ministry of Health has taken a Cambodian man and his wife for a virus-free sample. But Cambodia needs to find more stakeholders to take samples for inspection.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that the visit to the Cambodian man was to alleviate the fear of the people. He also called on all citizens not to be afraid of the COVID-19 virus, but to work together to prevent and solve this problem. At the same time, Samdech Hun Sen also forbade people from using the COVID-19 virus to spread pollution, especially for all Cambodians to believe in the Cambodian health system.
At the same time, the three also thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Ministry of Health and Siem Reap Provincial Health Department for taking great care of their health.
