Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Samdech did not prevent the purchase of rice and food stocks, but Samdech just called on sellers not to increase prices excessively when there is a strong demand.
The Prime Minister said that for the amount of rice in Cambodia, people should not worry about the shortage, because 400 mills of Cambodia stockpiled rice to supply domestic demand and export, which can ensure that even if Cambodia does not grow crops One year of rice, Cambodia does not lack rice to eat.
This statement was made by Samdech Techo on the occasion of the inauguration of National Road No. 55 and the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of National Road No. 10 in Pursat province this morning, March 9, 2020.
Please be informed that after the news of the spread of Covid-19 in Siem Reap, some people in the district bought rice and food stocks for fear of food shortages during the outbreak.
Following the rush to buy stockpiled rice to prevent anyone from taking the opportunity to raise prices, the Cambodian Rice Federation and the Green Trade Company of the Ministry of Commerce issued an urgent statement on the night of March 7, 2020. Call on people not to worry about the shortage of rice, which leads some opportunists to raise rice prices.
The Cambodian Rice Federation and the Green Trade Company of the Ministry of Commerce would like to announce to the Cambodian people that the amount of rice and unmilled rice of the members of the Cambodian Rice Federation throughout the country at the location of more than 400 mills is Enough to supply local demand and export until the next harvest.
In order to address the concerns and prevent the situation from opportunists to increase the price of rice excessively, the Cambodian Rice Federation has cooperated with Green Trade Company of the Ministry of Commerce to open rice sales on dates and places from Monday, March 9, 2020 in some locations.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered that such publicity could confuse Cambodia and could provoke outrage and protest from the Cambodian people because it was an unacceptable misrepresentation. Absolutely.
Speaking at the inauguration of National Road 55 in Veal Veng district, Pursat province on March 9, 2020, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated: "Even on Saturday and Sunday, I have to protest to the Foreign Minister to protest to Vietnam. "Why protest to Vietnam, not to the Vietnamese government, but Vietnam's VNA has published bad news about Cambodia, I'm not afraid."
According to a report from the Vietnamese Embassy to the Cambodian Ministry of Foreign Affairs, in the wake of the recent Corona crisis, Vietnam's health protection committee has recommended strengthening security at all nationalities, but VNA Vietnam says restrictions on citizens from Europe and Cambodia are different from what the Vietnamese Health Protection Board has announced.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated, "So Cambodia is in the ranking that Vietnam has been classified as a stranger, so I do not agree, I told Prak Sokhon (Head of Cambodian Diplomacy) to contact Vietnam immediately." Samdech said that if the newspaper did not remove the information, there would be protests against the ambassador to Vietnam.
