Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Inaugurating National Road 55 and Groundbreaking Ceremony for National Road 10
(Pursat): Another new historical achievement of Cambodia, National Road No. 55 connecting National Road No. 5 in Pursat provincial town to the rocky border with Trat, Thailand will be officially launched on Monday. March 9, 2020.
The following are the main remarks made by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the inauguration of National Road 55 and the opening of the construction site of National Road 10:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road 55 and the opening of National Road 10 are new achievements for Cambodia and the people of Pursat.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the peace that led to these achievements.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Veal Veng district, Pursat province, has been an isolated area since the French colonial period.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that under the win-win policy, the area of Veal Veng district was united and brought the Khmer Rouge separatists to live with the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered this to be a painful history in the past of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's past is very bitter and difficult to find peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as the son of a poor farmer, his only goal was to become a teacher, to become a problem solver and to find peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Chinese government is a good partner in the development of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expects Cambodians in other areas to visit Veal Veng district, which is a very favorable place for tourism.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges the opening of the Thmar Da border crossing connecting Cambodia's Pursat province with Thailand's Trat province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expects that the opening of this border checkpoint will increase the trade volume between the two countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is working to clear mines to make Cambodia a landmine-free country by 2025.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the people in the minefields to stay away, do not risk to act in the areas that have not been demined.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the presence of landmines and unexploded ordnance is an achievement left over from the war, which must be jointly demanded to protect the current peace from the recurrence of war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people of Veal Veng benefit the most from this road.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road No. 10 will provide convenient transportation for people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is currently trying to raise money to build long and standard roads.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen addressed the analysts in the analysis of the relationship between Cambodia and China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacted by saying that around the beating of Singaporean students by British students as well. Samdech Techo asked, "Where are the human rights?"
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to use scarves instead of masks to prevent Kovit 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he received a grant of nearly $ 1 million for medical equipment brand "Duy Pong" manufactured in Kampong Cham and Svay Rieng.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech planned to provide this aid to China, but China turned it back and added some more aid to fight the disease 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the doctors for their efforts to take samples of stakeholders and families of 19 men with Kovit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers the wife and relatives of a man with Kovit 19 to be very brave to come out and explain this issue.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that he will go to Siem Reap to prevent excessive fear.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the river festival in Battambang province was not postponed. Samdech plans to meet with government officials in Battambang province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on people to take measures to prevent coronary heart disease, but do not be overly afraid.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen responds to critics that if Cambodian doctors are weak, why do doctors in the United States and the West also die because of Kovit?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that his reaction came after VNA Vietnam reported that Vietnam restricted the travel of Cambodians.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that people with health problems should see a doctor for a medical examination.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warned individuals living in Kampong Trabek, Prey Veng province, to be wary of saying that Samdech had been secretly sent to Singapore.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on all countries not to paint Cambodia 19 on Kovit disease.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on factories not to take this opportunity to suspend and cancel their employment contracts with workers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requests microfinance and banks to waive interest for workers who suspend or delay payment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks home sellers to extend installments to workers or hotel workers, as well as the tourism sector during work delays.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks EDC to suspend non-payment of electricity bills for suspended workers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen provided a school building for a primary school with 3 floors, 18 rooms and a library office with 3 rooms, as well as a concrete road in the school.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen provided a school building at Pramoy High School, 3 floors, 18 rooms, a management office and a library, 3 rooms, a dormitory for students and teachers, 2 floors, 10 rooms, as well as concrete roads, gates and school fences.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people of Pursat do not hate Samdech. If the people hate, Samdech can not rule for more than 40 years.
