"I would also like to thank him for allowing me to shop and see the good roads, the borders and the natural forest that we see today," said Kang Kim Hourn. Samdech Techo Hun Sen Sends Congratulatory Message on International Women's Day March 8 and Shows Royal Government's Efforts to Promote Women
