Senior Minister Osman Hassan Meets with Head of Turkish Halal Approval Agency
The meeting was held to exchange experiences between the halal institutions of Cambodia and Turkey, especially to learn about HAK's advanced management system and techniques to further develop the halal institutions of Cambodia.
The Turkish Halal Approval Agency (HAK) is the only body authorized to operate halal certification services in Turkey, representing Turkey in international forums related to halal recognition and acting as a pioneer in the field.
HAK has established a globally recognized halal certification system in accordance with the standards of the Institute of Standards and Metrology for Islamic Countries (SMIIC), an institution accredited by the Organization of Islamic Cooperation (OIC).
