"Obviously, now all of us Buddhists have come together with a fresh face and a heart full of hope, faith, support for values and the maintenance of peace gained through blood transfusions and age," he said. The life of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and dignitary of the Cambodian People's Party from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
