He said that for the financial environment of women, the survey results show that about 73% of adult women will have access to official financial services in 2017 and will increase to 84% by 2025.
Ouk Maly, Deputy Governor of the National Bank of Cambodia, said that women are good partners in participating in social and economic activities as well as men. Women are indispensable partners in society, family and society as a whole, and women in various institutions are currently actively developing their work just like men.
She added that in 2020, Cambodia has raised the theme of Peace, Promoting Gender Equality to Celebrate the 119th Anniversary of International Women's Day on March 8, and the National Bank of Cambodia congratulates this theme. Of the peace that has enabled Cambodia to develop a nation that is as prosperous as it is today. Golden Stone School of World Hope teaches poor students for free, launches Chinese language program
(Phnom Penh): The Golden Stone of World Hope is an educational institution that conducts general education activities from grade 1 to grade 12 in accordance with the curriculum of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports for about 20 years. And.
The school, which started under the auspices of the Association "Hope in Cambodia" in 2002, operates as a non-profit. The school contributes to the education of students from poor families through free tuition.
Mr. Tan Kim Meng, Director of the Golden Stone of World Hope, said that the Golden Stone of World Hope has a mission to help train students from poor families to help families with many children and low-income families.
The Golden Stone School of World Hope started with just 50 students. But due to the quality of education and trust from the parents of the students, the number of students has increased every year, and now there are almost 500 students.
Among them, the high school pass rate (Bakdup) has a high rate of 93%. Students at the Golden Stone School of World Hope not only acquired general knowledge in line with the Ministry's education program, but also improved their English language skills.
According to Mr. Tan Kim Meng, the students at this school up to the sixth grade are able to speak English well because the school has added a special program for English taught by foreign teachers.
Seeing the high demand for Chinese language in the job market, the Golden Stone School of World Hope has entered into an agreement with Chinese schools that specialize in teaching Chinese to include Chinese language curricula.
The signing ceremony between the two schools took place on March 6, 2020. Mr. Tan Kim Meng expressed the hope that after incorporating Chinese into the curriculum, students will gain another knowledge of Chinese language as a capital for pursuing other skills after high school, especially with high opportunities for employment after graduation. Studies.
Tan Kim Meng also plans to include a Korean language learning program in the school. It should be noted that the Golden Stone School of World Hope has contributed to the training of human resources with 100 people who have the ability to work in government institutions such as the Pastor Institute and the private sector, as well as receive scholarships to study in the United States. Some, too.
