Authorities cut metal skeletons in violation of public roads in Chamkarmon district
(Phnom Penh): After the Chamkar Mon District Administration issued several notices to the innkeepers to completely dismantle the steel structure built on the sidewalk, but still refused to dismantle it, now the Khan Unity Command has started to implement it with the utmost restraint. Because it is in the common interest to organize public order to have order on the streets for pedestrians and improve the beauty in Chamkarmon district.
On the morning of March 6, 2020, the Khan Unity Command, led by Mr. Aing Serey Piseth, Deputy Governor, represented the District Governor, took administrative action to cut the steel skeleton, encroach on the public road, Street 103, and remove it without any trimming. Further understanding.
The strict administrative action took place after the district administration issued several notices, leaving the site owners to dismantle themselves for seven days, but refused to do so. So far, it has been more than 7 days, and the owners of the construction sites who violated the land did not comply with the notification, so the Khan Unity Command took administrative action to implement the content of the notification. Effective news.
Mr. Aing Serey Piseth confirmed that this morning, March 6, that the Khan Unity Command took administrative action to cut down the steel mills that were built in violation of the roadside land. The notification of the Khan Administration was issued twice and there was a record of thumbprints acknowledged by the owner of the location, so the Khan Unity Command took administrative action.
Mr. Aing Serey Piseth said that this administrative measure was made after the district administration informed three times and the owner of the location refused to implement it, so the command agreed to dismantle the steel plant without understanding.
It should be noted that Mr. Theng Sothol, Governor of Chamkar Mon District, has strongly stated that the Khan Unity Command will not back down, despite the challenges, it is necessary to take administrative action, there is no understanding because the Khan Administration has already informed.
At the same time, the Deputy District Governor instructed the Sangkat Chief and professional officers to pay more attention to law and order.
