The first is the repeated call for people not to be afraid, because fear is more dangerous than the Covid-19 virus. Samdech Techo Hun Sen clearly understands that the Cambodian people can lose control and create chaos in the society if the fear is not curbed, because on the one hand, the concern about the virus is covering the minds of many Cambodians, and on the other hand, it is inspiring. False information pollutes the society by some unscrupulous people.
Second: Demonstrations to the public, such as a request to visit Cambodian students in Wuhan, a face-to-face visit to Beijing without a mask at a time when the virus is exploding and allowing the Westerdam to dock. The Prime Minister himself goes out to greet tourists directly as the world is afraid and discriminates against them.
Thirdly, taking this opportunity to promote and mainstream a hygienic lifestyle to the Cambodian people because Samdech Techo Hun Sen clearly understands that hygiene is a fundamental principle in the prevention of all kinds of infectious diseases, not only Covid-19 No, and the weakness of the Cambodian people is living without caring much about hygiene.
It is also worth noting that Cambodians everywhere practice regular hygiene practices, such as washing their hands frequently, wearing a mask when they go to crowded places, or when they have a cold. Original. This is a new and positive attitude of the Cambodian people that can prevent the transmission of the Covid-19 virus so far.
Only when we look at these issues carefully can we understand the ingenuity of the leaders and understand how to lead and govern the country. Generally, when an emergency occurs, leaders send messages and act as role models to maintain the stability of the people and the national economy.
