(Phnom Penh): The AII Language Center (Aii) has expanded its curriculum for three days and weekends to facilitate and cater to a wide range of public needs for study at its foreign language training facilities. .
This English language program starts registration from today at all 6 branches of AII Language Center in Phnom Penh. The AII Language Center curriculum for three days is divided into two separate shifts.
The first shift is on Monday, Wednesday and Friday, with the first option from 6:00 am to 7:40 am, the second option from 11:20 am to 1:00 am. Afternoon and the last option from 6:00 pm to 7:40 pm, the study lasts for 10 weeks. For the second shift, study on Tuesdays, Thursdays and Saturdays, with the same choice of study time and duration as the first shift.
