(Phnom Penh): Golden FX Link Capital continues its success in the Cambodian derivatives market by ranking No. 1 in the total number of trading transactions for January 2020 among all derivatives brokers.
This rating is made public by the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia and is a regular rating by Golden FX Link Capital, reflecting the strong customer support as well as the professionalism, commitment and hard work of the company.
Golden FX Link Capital has been diligently recruiting financial advisors who are capable of providing professional market analysis and trading advice, sharing ongoing trading skills training and education. Extensive finance to the public.
