These unmissable advantages are attracting more and more investors to choose the investment services of Golden FX Link Capital.
Since the beginning of 2019, the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia has been issuing monthly derivatives trading operation reports, focusing on the total number of trading transactions in each month of all derivatives brokers in Cambodia.
The importance of this report is to promote legal markets and transparency in trading, to create positive competition among derivatives brokers, so that they continue to raise their standards, as well as to the public, especially investors. Significant updates on the order of leading derivatives brokerage firms.
Mr. Chea Sothea, CEO of Golden FX Link Capital, said that this achievement confirms that Golden FX Link Capital has been playing an important role in the Cambodian derivatives market. This is a great result for us and will encourage us to achieve even greater results in the future.
Mr. Sothea also praised and supported the decision of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia to release its monthly trading transaction report. He thanked all the customers for their trust and support of Golden FX Link Capital.
With a strong commitment to building success for the Cambodian derivatives market, Golden FX Link Capital will continue to make more achievements.
