Minister Mam Bunheng stated, "The Ministry of Health would like to inform the public that after receiving this clear information about the Covid-19 infection in Japanese men, the Ministry and the Siem Reap provincial authorities are working on this case." "In the most transparent way to avoid fear from the people and work with the most accurate procedures of the World Health Organization."
He added that at present, health officials and local authorities are working closely to find those who are in contact with and near the Japanese man to monitor and isolate him. They.
