Mr. Tea Seiha said that the provincial authorities have paid close attention to this issue in cooperation with the Japanese Consulate in Siem Reap, the Department and the Ministry of Health. According to the provincial health official and the Japanese consulate in the province, before the medical examination, the Japanese national did not have any symptoms of Kovit 19.
