(Kampong Thom): Senator Khuon Khundy said that the country is prosperous because of women who have maintained their culture, traditions and customs.
The senator said this at the celebration of the 109th anniversary of International Women's Day on March 8, 2020 under the theme: "Peace, Promoting Gender Equality" at Svay District Hall, Kampong Thom Province this morning. 2020, with the participation of the governor, deputy governor, district councilors, more than 500 female royal officials.
