Ms. Khuon Kundy commended the women for organizing the event with the aim of commemorating the struggle, perseverance and participation in changing people's attitudes to recognize and provide opportunities for women to benefit from economic, social and equal rights. Men to lead a life of harmony and prosperity free from vulnerability.
