Announcing the transfer of the Prosecutor of Kampong Cham Provincial Court, Mr. Chreung Khmao to replace Mr. Huot Wutty, who was promoted to the Prosecutor General of Tbong Khmum Provincial Court of Appeal
(Kampong Cham): Mr. Chreung Khmao, former Prosecutor of Stung Treng Provincial Court, has been announced as the new Prosecutor of Kampong Cham Provincial Court, replacing Mr. Huot Wutty, the former Prosecutor, who will be transferred to the new position of Prosecutor General. Appeal Tbong Khmum Province.
The handover ceremony took place on the morning of March 4, 2020 at Kampong Cham Provincial Hall, presided over by Mr. Prohm Seth Tra, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Justice and Mr. Heng Vanny, Deputy Governor of Kampong Cham Province.
