Mr. Ouk Narin, Director of Kampong Cham Provincial Fisheries Administration, said that according to the note from the Provincial Governor of Kampong Cham on the request of Ms. Vanavin to set up a fish transfer station and a fishing business in the area. Om River, Kampong Cham City.
