Samdech Heng Samrin: The current peace and development is actively contributed by women from all walks of life
On the morning of March 4, 2020, National Assembly President Samdech Heng Samrin (R) met with a delegation of women from public, private and civil society organizations led by Dr. Ing Kantha Phavi, Minister of Women's Affairs, to celebrate the 109th anniversary. International Women's March 8, 2020.
