(Preah Sihanouk): The construction project of Phnom Penh-Sihanoukville Expressway has a total length of more than 190 km, connecting Village 1, Sangkat Samrong Krom, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh to Village 1, Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville. It is scheduled to open in September 2022.
