The introduction was made on the occasion of Minister Veng Sakhon presiding over the opening ceremony of the meeting to review the results of agricultural legislation in 2019 and work direction for 2020, which was held at Sokha Angkor Hotel, Siem Reap this morning. March 2, 2020 and with the participation of the leadership of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, a large number of government officials.
