At the same time, Mr. Theng Sothol also said that the reason for the congestion is because there is no water in the canal that can bring garbage to the pumping station for workers to collect. He said that as a measure, we do not pump out the water, let the water flood, then we put the machine down to collect garbage and transport it out.
