On this occasion, Mr. Sokhom Rithivuth, Chairman of the National Dental Council, said that the Dental Board of Cambodia has observed that Allianz Pharmaceutical Cambodia La Bosanofi is an international company that imports high quality and effective drugs in the field of dentistry. Like RODOGYL, it is highly effective in treating oral diseases.
On the other hand, Allian Pharma Cambodia Labosanofi has the potential to be a good partner to help the Dental Council of Cambodia in the professional development of dentists in order to increase the professional capacity to provide quality services to the people. And safety.
Dr. Lim Huy, Head of Medical and Regulatory Affairs, Allianz Pharmaceuticals, said that RODOGYL® has been marketed in Cambodia and has been supported by Cambodian dentists, doctors and patients for more than 10 years.
Not only this time, the company cooperates with the National Dental Council of Cambodia, we have already cooperated with other provincial dental organizations in almost all provinces in Cambodia.
"RODOGYL® is a combination of two antibiotics, spiracycin and metronidazole," he said. "It is made specifically for dentists and general practitioners to prescribe for patients with bacterial infections in the mouth and to prevent infection after oral surgery or extractions."
The benefits of a combination of these two antibiotics are to cover, prevent and kill most of the bacteria in the mouth, which are often caused by two major groups of bacteria: oxygen-deficient and anaerobic. In addition, this combination increases the feasibility and effectiveness of preventing and killing bacteria.
This drug is highly effective in treating oral patients, especially it is a necessary drug in the field of dentistry. This was further confirmed by Dr. Heng Sopanha, Professor of Dentistry.
