(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Municipal Police on February 28, 2020, came out and completely rejected and rejected some news content that reported that there was a case of shooting and robbing a motorbike near Borey Angkor Phnom Penh in Sangkat Toul Sangke Ty. 2 Khan Russey Keo on the night of February 27, 2020.
The Information and Quick Reaction Team of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police confirmed that this case was a fabrication of a young man, and today he came to confess and apologize to the authorities at the Tuol Sangke II Administrative Police Station for what he got. Lying to the authorities.
After conducting research by the police and according to the explanation and confession of the victim, it was said that it was not a case of robbery, it was a case of cheating a friend who borrowed his motorcycle and took it away without finding it back. Fearing that his family would blame him when he returned home, he fabricated a story to tell his family that he had been robbed of his motorcycle around Angkor Borey in Phnom Penh.
