(Phnom Penh): In addition to preventing the spread of the COVID-19 respiratory virus that is exploding and rapidly evolving around the world, on the afternoon of February 28, 2020, Ms. Youk Sambath, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health Directly inspected the security at the entrances and exits at Phnom Penh International Airport.
