However, SGW did not make any effort to improve its construction obligations, which clearly shows that it is not capable of completing the project on time. Therefore, in order to avoid further delays, Oxley James decided to terminate the construction contract with SGW in October 2019.
Once the construction contract with SGW is terminated, the company is obliged to leave the project site in order for CRUCG to take over the site to continue construction on the project.
However, SGW violated its contractual obligations by refusing to leave the project site and illegally occupying the project. This action caused the construction of the project to be delayed as CRUCG could not enter the project site to start its work.
As a result, Oxley James has filed a protection order with the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, requesting that the court order SGW to leave the project site in order for Oxley James to exercise its legal rights as owner and company. Project development.
On February 25, 2020, the Bailiff of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court began to implement the protection order at the project site in accordance with the legal procedures in force with the assistance of the competent authorities. During the implementation, SGW refused to cooperate with the bailiff and the authorities and even blocked the implementation of the court order by clashing with the competent authorities.
As for SGW's actions against the court's decision and obstruction of the authorities while performing their duties, Auxiliary James' lawyers stated that this act could be considered an offense under the laws of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
Despite these constraints, the bailiff was later able to successfully remove the SGW team from the project site, and to this day, Auxiliary James is able to fully occupy and manage the project site, so CRUCG Construction work may resume in the near future.
Oxley James is currently ordering its attorneys to study the legal aspects and file a claim for damages from SGW for any damages it has suffered as a result of its breach of duty and illegal activities. SGW. The Governor of Kampong Thom Province calls on all institutions to cooperate with the media and prevent false information.
