Witnesses said that prior to the incident, they saw a motorcycle driven by the victim alone and an excavator traveling in the same direction from north to south, suddenly came to the scene and the road conditions were wet. The victim slipped and fell under the excavator while driving, causing her to break her head and die immediately at the scene.
