The First Deputy Secretary-General conveyed the message from Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to all grandchildren and great-grandchildren that they must take good care of their health, eat well and drink boiled water, and love each other. Help each other and stay away from bad friends or drug use, and strive to study hard for a prosperous future to become a good citizen and an outstanding human resource of society.
At the same time, all the children and staff also expressed their deep gratitude to Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, who always gave warm love, encouragement and hope to the orphans. All the children said in unison, "I love peace and the Cambodian Red Cross."
At the same time, the President of the New Smile Association of Children's Hope, Mr. Pen Sophal, expressed his great excitement after receiving continuous attention after Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, the humanitarian mother of Cambodian children. Mothers always think of solving and alleviating the suffering of every child without leaving any child behind.
In fact, "This is the fourth time since the association was established in 2017 that humanitarian mothers have sent representatives to visit and find out about living conditions and needs to meet the needs of all children. "Nearly 50 of them, 40 of them children, are orphans because their parents divorced, leaving them without food and shelter."
