(Svay Rieng): Lt. Gen. Chao Phirith, Deputy Director General of the General Department of Technical Equipment and Chairman of the Chheu Teal Commune Assistance Team, Svay Chrum District, Svay Rieng Province, stated that the values of peace have brought development and progress in all areas under the right leadership. Of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
Lt. Gen. Chao Phirith added that the value of the "win-win" strategy of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has brought peace and progress in all areas, including democracy, respect for human rights, political stability and strong economic growth. Which is an important suffix to reduce poverty of the people.
He emphasized that the vision of the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, is to promote sustainable and equitable socio-economic development through the establishment of a national working group to implement the principles of good governance, which is at the core of the Rectangular Strategy.
