Real Estate Experts: East of Phnom Penh is a rising real estate area that is most suitable for residential construction.
The assertion of this real estate expert on February 26, 2020 at the groundbreaking ceremony for the housing project of Borey KS, located in Phum Taeng, Phum Thom commune, Kien Svay district, Kandal province.
Dr. Kim Heang stated that the four parts of Phnom Penh, the eastern part of Phnom Penh, especially Kien Svay area, are the most suitable areas for housing and tourism and will not be suitable for industrial areas, because in fact, this Kien Svay area Rich in natural trees and fruits and suitable for those who already have a job somewhere.
Dr. Kim Heang added that for Borey KS, he will now partner with Japan to bring solar panels to be used in apartments to replace state electricity to help reduce the use of state electricity. The solar system can be used on air conditioners, refrigerators and light bulbs, and the first step will be to test 50 homes where the solar system will not worry about power outages that people have encountered in the past.
He added that this project Borey KS focuses on people who are originally from Svay Rieng, Prey Veng and Kandal, especially local people and work near Phnom Penh or in Phnom Penh. They can buy this house to stay and they will be easy to visit the district from time to time without having to spend time from Phnom Penh to a house in another area, having to go through Phnom Penh again and have to go through a very congested area.
Please be reminded that the Royal Government of Cambodia recently announced a stamp duty exemption for people buying houses under 70,000 US dollars from a housing development company registered with the Ministry of Economy and Finance. Please be informed that this Borey KS project is built on an area of 34,097 square meters and has a total of more than 200 apartments, starting to announce the sale in the next few months for more information about Borey KS 012 44 96 44.
