National Road No. 58 has a total length of 174.16 km, connecting Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province to Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province, of which the main road is 165.18 km long. This road passes through Banteay Meanchey province with a length of 92 km and Oddar Meanchey province with a length of 73.18 km and 4 parallel roads with a total length of 8.98 km, separating from National Road No. 58 to the Cambodia-Thailand border gate. Korky and Thmor Daun.
