Minister Thong Khon announces Samdech Techo's 7-point measures in the face of reducing international tourism
(Phnom Penh): 2019 shows the new growth of community tourism and ecotourism, along with the awareness of people and tourism in sanitation, environment and green tourism development, but at the end of the year there is a decline in international tourists. Due to many factors that have been happening around the world.
Around this challenge, the Royal Government of Cambodia, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as Prime Minister, has taken a series of measures to address this issue, and Samdech Techo has recently issued seven more important rules to support the tourism sector, which is facing a deficit.
These measures were announced by Minister Thong Khon at the opening ceremony of the 2019 Annual Meeting of the Ministry of Tourism at the Sokha Residence Hotel in Phnom Penh on February 26, 2020.
* First: Exemption (State in charge of substitute tax) on all types of monthly tax payments of hotels and guesthouses registered with the General Department of Taxation and doing business in Siem Reap for a period of four months from February. Until May 2020. The hotel and guesthouse business is still obliged to file tax returns and use the online system to manage value-added tax (E-VAT) every month during this tax exemption period.
* Second, do not conduct a full audit for the period of 2020 for enterprises in the hotel and guesthouse sector that are registered with the General Department of Taxation and have business activities in Siem Reap.
* Fourth: Increase the efficiency of joint travel by land, sea and air, especially with neighboring countries (such as Bangkok-Siem Reap and Ho Chi Minh-Siem Reap), especially by bus or private car by facilitating the settlement. Effectiveness of challenges at cross-border services and other related issues.
* Fifth: The Ministry of Tourism and relevant ministries and institutions must launch campaigns to organize activities and attractive events in Siem Reap, such as Angkor Sankranti (2020), traditional religious festivals, sports programs, concerts, film screenings and fashion shows. Origin for attracting national and international tourists.
* 6th: Keep the ticket price for Angkor area the same, but add the number of days for each type of ticket, tickets for 1 day can be accessed for 2 days, tickets for 3 days can be accessed for 5 days and tickets for 7 days can be entered Watch 10 days to attract more tourists to stay in Cambodia.
