Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth Chairs the 4th Sub-National Administrative Investment Management Board Meeting
(Phnom Penh): The Board of Directors of the Sub-National Administration Investment Fund held its 4th Board Meeting under the chairmanship of Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the Board of Directors of the Sub-National Investment Fund. (AEC).
A meeting was held at the Ministry of Economy and Finance on February 25, 2020, with the participation of members of the Board of Directors of the Sub-National Administrative Investment Management Fund, who represent 16 ministries and institutions, the National Association, the Capital Council. Provinces and national alliances, associations of municipal councils, districts, Khans, communes and sangkats.
The "Sub-National Administration Investment Fund" is a new mechanism for providing additional resources in addition to the existing resources to sub-national administrations in order to promote socio-economic development at the sub-national level by financing investment projects. The public administration of the sub-national administration is strategic and encourages the sub-national administration to improve the performance and better management of public investment.
The 4th meeting of the Board of Directors of the Sub-National Administrative Investment Fund reviewed and discussed the following agenda:
* Progress of the implementation of the decision of the 3rd Board Meeting of the Board of Management of the Sub-National Administrative Investment Fund, * Review of the progress report of the Secretariat of the ECCC 2019 * Review and approve the draft action plan CAVE 2020 and review and approve the draft budget for CEC 2020.
