1: The CEC Secretariat, in coordination with the Secretariat of the National Committee for Sub-National Democratic Development (NCDD), prepares to implement a competition mechanism for receiving funding for commune administrations, leaving the provincial administration Responsible for managing and implementing this mechanism.
