Lawyer Kong Sam Onn argues that industrial painting is a relatively new entity, so it requires protection for the owner, and if there is protection, those who pay to find something new will benefit. What he found. There are many types of intellectual property protection, such as systemic products or trademarks. If there is protection, experts will strive to find new things to contribute to meeting the needs of people.
