According to the letter from the Phnom Penh Capital Administration, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration is preparing the bidding documents and procedures for the selection of companies to collect and transport solid waste in Phnom Penh in a transparent and efficient manner in accordance with international standards in accordance with laws and regulations. Legal force in force of Cambodia.
