It should be noted that before the recent meeting of the Council of Ministers, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, announced after removing the right to collect garbage from Cintri, and when the state is stable, the state will select four different companies to Garbage collection in Phnom Penh divided into 4 areas. The garbage fee is also deducted from the electricity bill.
