The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia underlined that the current tax collection uses technology to collect taxes. Through technology, tax collection is accurate, transparent and no more tax revenue is lost.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen once pointed out that Cambodia earns about $ 250 million per month from customs duties and taxes, and some months up to $ 300 million. In 2019, Cambodia earned about $ 6 billion in tax revenue.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also praised the use of technology in car registration and purchase of license plates of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport. Samdech Techo emphasized that the modernization of the car registration service and the purchase of license plates has facilitated car owners and helped increase national income.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, after taking over the Ministry of Public Works and Transport in 2016, has introduced reforms on the provision of services by several ministries. The minister has tried to modernize services by integrating them with technology.
Vehicle registration and license plates are a complex issue in the ministry. After the automated vehicle registration system was officially launched in 2017, many complex issues were eliminated. This automation system not only eliminates the hassle of registering and making license plates, but also increases the revenue from license plate sales.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol said that after the launch of the automation system, the Ministry has achieved good results and raised more than 32 million US dollars from the sale of special numbers by 2019.
In addition, the Ministry also launched an automated system to sell more special personal numbers on January 7, 2020. The sale of this special number is an additional opportunity for people to find the vehicle ID of their choice and can be owned for life and passed on to their children.
According to Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, from the official launch date until January 31, 2020, this special number plate sold 434 plates and received a national revenue of nearly 2 million US dollars.
