It should be noted that the eloquent elder Kong Nai received the Fukuoka Art and Culture Award of Japan in 2017 and received the title of Hero of the Living Heritage from Samdech Techo after Chapey Dangveng Cambodia was inscribed on the Intangible Cultural Heritage List of Humanity. Today, he is 74 years old and lives in Doung village, Svay Tong Khang Cheung commune, Kampong Trach district, Kampot province.
