Mr. Thong Khon also made a suggestion to the delegates of the Peace-loving Youth Coalition, which is to organize programs to promote various tourist resorts in the country so that the people can see them through advertisements aimed at inspiring and encouraging them. They are interested in visiting, while Mr. Panh Khem Bunthon and his youth group also have experience in performing this work.
