Mr. Panh Khem Bunthorn and the delegation of the Peaceful Youth Coalition expressed their high commitment to the work introduced by Minister Thong Khon to jointly promote the domestic tourism movement to attract foreign tourists and promote national tourism in accordance with the recommendations. Of the Head of the Royal Government, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Father of Peace.
