The leader, who has been Cambodia's prime minister for about 35 years, said: "So do not think that I'm leaving the United States, leaving Europe to capture China alone. You are wrong about my position, Meas Ny is wrong. I have not abandoned America, nor have I abandoned Europe. "I still have all relations with Europe."
