(Prey Veng): About 10 military officers from the Ministry of National Defense's Engineering Division beat people to the back of their houses due to an argument at 2:30 pm on February 23, 2020 in Pong Teuk village, Kraing Tayong commune. Peam Chor District, Prey Veng Province.
Peam Chor district police said that a case of violence occurred when a group of engineers from the Ministry of National Defense, about 10 people, attacked a group of people living in the upper commune, causing injuries on both sides. . Causes of verbal conflicts.
Authorities said that in this incident, a villager named So Sophal alias Sveth, 26 years old, was arrested and handed over to the Kraing Tayong commune administrative post.
Currently, the Peam Chor district police force has handed over the suspect as a military officer to the provincial police force to build a case for further legal proceedings.
Mr. Chea Heng confirmed that the story that led to the use of violence is that on the night of February 22, 2020, there was a concert program in Ta Huy village, Kampong Prasat commune, bordering Kraing Tayong commune.
In this ceremony, there was a little drinking and arguing, and in the morning, both sides were transporting land on the same road, in which a group of people also had a land truck, and also asked each other what happened last night? Violence erupted as the villagers fled, while the engineering team chased and fought until they reached the houses of the villagers in Pong Teuk village, Kraing Tayong commune.
