(Phnom Penh): In a meeting with the Supreme Advisory Council at the Peace Palace this morning, February 23, 2020, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, thanked Mr. Pich Sros, President The Cambodian Youth Party and a member of the Supreme Advisory Council, which provided important input in connection with a sea clearing case in Koh Kong province caused by a senior military official.
