The case of clearing land into the sea in Smach Meanchey village, Sangkat Smach Meanchey, Khemarak Phoumin city, Koh Kong province, was established by General Tun Diet in December 2019. In this case, Mr. Pich Sros, President of the Cambodian Youth Party, led the delegation to the actual location and researched until he found that the two-star general, a senior officer, had indeed wiped the sand off the sea.
