Samak, a model farmer, stated that he now raises up to 10 kilograms of red worms, which are imported from abroad, while raising them in a foam hut. In 1 liter, put 1 kg of earthworm seeds, the food it eats is only cow dung mixed with normal soil and is not difficult to maintain, just water two to three times a day.
