Mr. Por Leang Kong said that the chemical Burac has a serious effect on people who eat foods that contain this chemical is causing kidney problems, headaches, digestive system inflammation, stomach, intestines, liver, skin itching. For adults, a mixture of 7 to 35 grams is fatal, for adults 15 grams and children 5 grams can cause vomiting and death.
