(Phnom Penh): Dr. Kouch Mengly said that most back pain often occurs in the elderly, obese and those who work long hours. On the other hand, sleeping on a mattress, sitting too bent over and lifting heavy objects can also cause back pain.
Generally, back pain, if the condition is mild, we can treat by taking medicine or injecting painkillers, but if the condition is severe, we need surgery. There are two types of surgical treatment: small and large. The larger type is surgically grafted into the bone (implanted), while the smaller type is simply surgically removed without the need to graft the bone.
According to Dr. Kouch Mengly, we can prevent this disease by implementing some points such as:
If you have back pain, you should hurry to the hospital to see a doctor for proper examination and treatment, avoid letting go until the condition worsens into chronic back pain.
