Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of closing the meeting of the Ministry of Interior
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of February 20, 2020, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, closed the meeting to review the work results of 2019 and raise the work direction for 2020 of the Ministry of Interior. The ceremony took place at the Ministry of Interior.
On this occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a keynote speech with the following main contents:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised and highly appreciated the civil servants at all levels at the sub-national level who worked hard to achieve all the work for the society and the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen highly appreciates the National Police Force for its joint efforts to maintain security and order and prevent any evil ambitions that attempt to cause unrest to destroy security and order.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen highly appreciates the police force that has made efforts to prevent the use of drug trafficking, strengthen traffic law enforcement, control immigrants and so on.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the introduction of the village and commune policy is safe and correct, but has not yet grasped the key to implementation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen agreed with the polls that have high confidence in the Royal Government and believe in the CPP in maintaining peace for the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that people no longer need sarongs, scarves and rice, but need to maintain security for them.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that we must increase the trust of the people by providing security for his life.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen supports the amendment of the traffic law to impose more severe penalties for drivers who violate the law.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recommends more fines until the driver's license is revoked when the driver violates the law.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the more severe sanctions are not a punishment for drivers, but a protection for their lives.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also recommended strict application for those who do not wear a helmet while driving.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that currently the water in the dam is up to 80%. So this year's power supply is not as problematic as last year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that Cambodia is implementing a reduction of 1 cent per kilowatt of electricity for the industrial sector.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that there was no diplomatic dispute between Cambodia and Malaysia over the discovery of American women with coronavirus.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns broadcasters to be intimidated and to hide information about coroner cases in Cambodia, beware of imprisonment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announced that Samdech does not need to take human life for political gain. The work that Samdech does is purely humanitarian.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told commentators that Samdech and Samdech Krala Hom had differing views on the Corona case and intended to split Samdech. Samdech considers that comment as a misunderstanding of the internal heart of the Cambodian People's Party.
* Samdech Techo stated that the work at the national level is reduced to the sub-national level, so the responsibility is bigger.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that he will remove the position of Capital and Provincial Governor if he does not attend the Capital and Provincial Council meetings three times.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised to set a specific time for the meeting between the Capital and Provincial Governors and the Capital-Provincial Council.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warned the provincial governors not to underestimate the president of the provincial council.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Lem Lem officials always run to this person, that person who has the right to nominate for a position. Samdech Techo added that now is not the time to intervene for the role, it is time to look at work efficiency.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges officials at the national level not to compete for positions and roles at the grassroots level.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the provincial governor and the chairman of the provincial council must agree to apply for the appointment of officials.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that it will take 3 hours to remove the provincial governor and 15 minutes to remove the district governor.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ended his speech at 5:30 pm the same day. National Bank of Cambodia announces recruitment of 16 contract staff
