Speaking at a press conference on the morning of February 20, 2020, organized by the Spokesperson of the Royal Government under the theme "Progress and direction of the Ministry of National Assembly Senate Relations and Inspection" Mr. Nop Channarin confirmed that as planned. This website will be officially launched in 2020.
