(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of Thursday, February 20, 2020, the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen will close the meeting to review the work results in 2019 and set work directions. 2020 of the Ministry of Interior. The ceremony took place at the Ministry of Interior.
The Ministry of Interior is an important body of the Royal Government, with the mission of leading all levels of local administration in the areas of politics, administration, management of the National Police Force in the areas of national security, public order and social security.
In 2019, the Ministry of Interior led by Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior has achieved many achievements.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng pointed out that in 2019, the National Police Force, with the cooperation of law enforcement forces, authorities at all levels and support the participation of people from all walks of life through the implementation of the village and commune policy. Security has been actively working together to prevent and suppress crimes in society more effectively.
Although the number of criminal offenses in 2019 increased slightly (8% increase) due to the influx of foreigners, which brought with it the crimes committed among some foreigners, the National Police Force Efforts were made to crack down on 89% of the crimes that occurred, a higher rate than in 2018.
Along with this, the number of crimes that affect the social psychology, such as theft, aggravated murder, intentional violence, fraud and illegal use of weapons, has decreased significantly.
Regarding the management of the presence of immigrants, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng emphasized that more attention was being paid to the people's support after the completion of the campaign to confiscate irregular Cambodian administrative documents. Foreigners occupy and use.
At the same time, the management of entry and exit through the gates has also been strengthened and improved by streamlining the entry and exit procedures for travelers, while increasing the management of various targets to contribute to strengthening national security. .
In addition, to facilitate the entry and exit of citizens, automatic gates (E-Gate) at the international airport have been put in place instead of filling in the information in the ticket office.
