(Phnom Penh): The pedestrian bridge at Phsar Doeum Kor, which is 27 meters long and 3 meters wide, has so far reached 85% and will be completed on March 5. On the night of February 19, 2020, from 8 pm to 6 am, the team completed the installation of the steel frame of the bridge.
