The project to build a pedestrian flyover in front of Doeum Kor Market will be built across the western Mao Tse Tung Road next to Doeum Kor Market. As for the project to build a pedestrian flyover in front of Santhor Mok Primary School, it will be built at the intersection of 4 directions, namely, 2 crossings of Mao Tse Tung Road and 2 lanes of Kampuchea Krom Road to make it easier for students to cross. This road is safe no matter where they come from.
