He added that through the new partnership with Sweden and UNICEF, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports will continue to strengthen the education system to better meet the educational needs of all children in Cambodia.
In addition, Ms. Christian Monde, UNICEF Country Director for Cambodia, highlighted the importance of this new partnership in expanding the potential and way of life for children in Cambodia.
She said that despite the many advances in the field of education, many children in Cambodia continue to have low school performance due to many reasons, such as the quality of teaching and learning environment. Low and so on. This partnership will support the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports in implementing key programs that provide better quality and equitable education to all children in Cambodia.
