Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng presents the main achievements of the Ministry of Interior in 2019
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of the Ministry of Interior, on the occasion of opening the meeting to review the work results in 2019 and the direction of the Ministry of Interior this morning, February 19, 2020, presented some important achievements. Which the institutions under the Ministry strive to achieve in 2019.
The achievements of Prince Sar Kheng include:
* The National Police Force, with the cooperation of law enforcement forces, authorities at all levels and supporting the participation of people from all walks of life through the implementation of the policy of safe villages and communes, has actively participated in the prevention and suppression of crime. Offenses in society are more effective.
In fact, although the crime rate in 2019 increased slightly (8% increase) due to the influx of foreigners brought with it the crimes committed among some foreigners, the National Police Force Efforts to crack down on 89% of the crimes that occur are higher than in 2018.
Along with this, the number of crimes that affect social psychology, such as aggravated theft, rape, intentional violence, fraud and illegal use of weapons, has decreased significantly.
* Controlling the presence of immigrants is also gaining more and more attention and gaining the support of the people after the completion of the campaign to confiscate irregular Cambodian administrative documents held by foreigners.
At the same time, the management of entry and exit through the gates has also been strengthened and improved by streamlining the entry and exit procedures for travelers, along with increasing the management of various targets to contribute to strengthening national security. .
The restructuring of the management system involved the transfer of 54 functions and 162 sub-functions to the municipal, district and khan administration. In addition, the Royal Government has also issued a sub-decree on the transfer of health services to the Capital and Provincial Administration.
The new progress of the reform process will make sub-national administrations more capable of providing public services and local development to meet local needs, which strengthens the accountability of sub-national administrative councils with its people. Its.
At the same time, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng also claimed that in addition to the above achievements, there are many other achievements that the Ministry of Interior strives to achieve in 2019, such as strengthening prison management while increasing Number of inmates nationwide's fourth anti-drug campaign.
In addition, the implementation of public financial management reform programs, human resource capacity building training for both civil administration and national police, enhancing relations and cooperation with associations, non-governmental organizations, international organizations and countries, and Inter-institutional coordination cooperation with various ministries and institutions of the Royal Government.
