A woman named Kim Bonna described how to make dried roasted peppers. First, the peppers are cut in half and soaked in hot water, then a little salt is added to make the peppers dry and can be stored. Long time no see. After that, they have to put the fresh peppers on the tab and dry them for several days until they are well dried, then put them in a bag for sale.
This business is only done during the growing season, and this business can also earn some income to support the family life, not only can the villagers have jobs and earn a regular income. Days, both young and old.
