She emphasized that the National Committee for the Prevention of Trafficking in Persons was "ready to prepare for the return or repatriation of workers," he said. This return faces the same problems as in 2014.
What the Cambodian authorities are thinking now is how to ensure the safety of migrant workers who may return from departure to return to live in the community. This is what Ms. Chou Bun Eng highlighted.
