(Phnom Penh): In the incident of fire, a house selling mattresses, furniture and 4 flats along Veng Sreng Street, Trapeang Thleung 3 Village, Sangkat Choam Chao I, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh, at around 6 am on February 15, 2020. So far, the damage has been more than $ 500,000.
