(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chan Darong, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Rural Development, confirmed that the Ministry will coordinate with the Ministry of Public Works and Transport to amend some sub-decrees to be able to implement preventive measures on the limit weight trucks driving on the road. In the countryside.
