According to the senior official, the Ministry is preparing to amend Sub-Decree No. 51 on the organization and functioning of the Ministry of Rural Development and Sub-Decree No. 141 on the establishment of a steering committee to control the weight limit. Today, in this sub-decree, there is no authority of the Ministry of Rural Development to participate in the implementation of measures to prevent vehicles transporting vehicles that exceed the weight limit on rural roads.
