Suspect's name is Yan Sopharo, alias Roth, 19 years old. His occupation is not real.
Police said that after receiving information from the public that there was trafficking at the village hall, the police immediately cooperated with the specialized force to arrive at the scene and saw a suspect standing in the hall. Suspicious, the police also stopped to check and found drugs in his left hand.
According to the confession of the suspect, Yan Sopharo, also known as Roth, confessed that he went to buy drugs from an unknown man in the area of 2 deer in Phnom Penh to resell.
