(Phnom Penh): On the morning of February 17, 2020, the Phnom Penh Municipal Court began hearing the case of illegal production, trafficking and storage of drugs at the entertainment venue "Miami" located on Street 360, Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang I, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh. The defendants involved in this case are Sreng Virak, Sarosaden, Dam Sarath, Ngin Samnang and Bun Rath.
