These youths and suspects acted aggressively. The owner of the "Miami" club was confirmed by the authorities to have been imprisoned for eight years in connection with drug offenses and released from prison in 2015.
After testing the urine of more than 50 youths detained during a drug bust operation at a nightclub, police found 32 youths with drugs.
Mr. Bun Satya confirmed that all the youths arrested during the crackdown were allowed to return, while those without drugs and those with drugs were sent to drug rehabilitation centers.
Please be informed that the police force of the Bureau of Minor Offenses of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police under the direct command of Lt. Gen. Thet, Deputy Commissioner of the National Police and Phnom Penh Municipal Commissioner, at 2:00 AM on April 11, 2019, conducted the operation. Crack down on "Miami" entertainment club, arresting more than 50 men and women and some drugs.
