(Phnom Penh): Eleven reinforced concrete roads with a length of more than 3 km and the installation of drainage system along these 11 roads with the construction of Borey "Leng Navatra" of "Galaxy Navatra Group" has been opened Construction site on the morning of February 15, 2020 to facilitate people to travel as well as reduce traffic congestion on some major roads.
The ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Suy Serith, Deputy Governor of Phnom Penh, on behalf of Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, as well as Mr. Hem Darith, Governor of Por Senchey District, and was attended by nearly 1,000 people in Borey Leng Nava. Tra »is located in Trapeang Romchek village, Sangkat Choam Chao I, Khan Por Sen Chey.
