In addition, Mr. Leng Navatra will spend more of his own money to repair 11 reinforced concrete roads with a length of 3,195 meters at a cost of 613,440 dollars and install a sewer system at a cost of 159,600 dollars in Trapeang Romchek village, Choam Chao Ty commune. 1, which has been opening the site to make it easier for people to travel, as well as reduce traffic congestion on some major roads.
