Apparently, now the private company Galaxy Shinawatra Group has built the infrastructure, including the road, including the drainage network on the side of the road, this area in the future will be a small city with a green area.
Mr. Suy Serith also stated, "For our Phnom Penh today, there are three problems: traffic congestion, garbage congestion and sewer congestion, which Phnom Penh administration under the leadership of Mr. Khuong Sreng. Phnom Penh has been paying close attention to improving these three issues.
