This pagoda is called Wat Sangkha Rattanamony, also known as Wat Tech Sovannaphum, located in Nikom Leu village, Sralop commune, Tbong Khmum district, Tbong Khmum provincial town (on National Road 73 north of Heng Samrin University, Tbong Khmum, 400 meters away). Wat Preah Nam Kim Dina.
Through this, the Chief Bishop of the pagoda and the Buddhists at the foot of the pagoda decided to celebrate the Flower Festival and bury the foundation stone on February 29, 2020 to collect the suffix to start building this pagoda, under the initiative of Mr. Cheam Chansophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum Province, and Mrs. Yet Sokha, Preah Anukun of Tbong Khmum District, Van Davy and Buddhists near and far.
