Give blood, give love on Valentine's Day, February 14! Director of Ratanakkiri Provincial Health Department calls on people throughout the province to donate blood
(Ratanakkiri): The Blood Transfusion Center of Ratanakkiri Provincial Referral Hospital on February 14, 2020, cooperated with the Provincial Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia to organize a voluntary blood donation campaign under the theme "Peace, Love! Give blood, give love! ” From 8 am to 4 pm at the Blood Transfusion Center of Ratanakkiri Provincial Referral Hospital in Banlung.
