(Phnom Penh): American University of AUPP is a well-known higher education institution for undergraduate and postgraduate education, taught by US professors with doctoral degrees from universities in the United States, Australia, Europe and developed countries. Other.
AUPP Master's Degree aims to prepare graduates for business success, both domestically and internationally, in Southeast Asia and around the world.
With a standard American curriculum and lectures by highly experienced American and Western professors, students will be qualified to deepen their knowledge of business strategy, leadership, entrepreneurship, management. With expertise in finance, marketing or international business.
Students only need 18 months to complete this master's degree by studying three days a week, Monday, Wednesday, Friday from 5:30 to 8:30 p.m.
Students who complete a master's degree will receive a globally recognized degree.
Start providing study counseling and accept applications from the date of this notice onwards. The new course starts on May 11, 2020.
