A security guard guarding the construction site of the flyover at Chom Chao roundabout was found dead in a checkpoint guarding a heart attack.
(Phnom Penh): Surprising incident in the morning after finding a man who was a security guard guarding the construction site of the Choam Chao flyover, he died without knowing the cause, suspected of having a heart attack. This incident happened on the morning of February 14, 2020, at the checkpoint at the construction site of the Choam Chao roundabout flyover in Thnal Bapek village, Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
According to the local police, the body of the victim, named Si Sereyvath, 33 years old, was born in Srah Chak commune, Daun Penh district, Phnom Penh, currently living at house 11, village 4, Veng Sreng street, Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Last night, the victim went to guard and slept as usual in the station, but in the morning did not see the victim wake up. As for the other workers who went to work there, they shouted and woke up. When they arrived, they suddenly saw that the victim had died of asphyxiation, which caused a great surprise immediately. The foreman in the above site also reported to the local authorities immediately.
Immediately after receiving this information, the local police of the 3rd Chao Chao Post, in cooperation with the specialized police of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, immediately went to the scene to investigate and inspect and the above-mentioned construction site transported the victim's body from the scene. Why come to Wat Chumpouvann to improve the skills of the police, the technical office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police for forensic examination.
Authorities said that after passing an expert examination, it was concluded that the victim died of asphyxiation, a heart attack caused by death. The bodies of the victims are waiting to be handed over to their relatives for a traditional ceremony. Po Sen Chey District Governor Leads Officers to Inspect the Site of the Canal in Sangkat Trapeang Krasang
