Please be informed that Samdech Techo Hun Sen said in an interview to Mr. Lim Chea Vutha, Executive Director of Fresh News that allowing the ship to enter shows the elimination of the disease that is happening in the world. Samdech Techo added that Cambodia does not have racism must participate in humanitarian work while tourists on board are in danger.
(Koh Kong): Mr. Long Sipo, Deputy Chief of Koh Kong Provincial Tax and Excise Branch, on February 13, 2020, led his subordinates in cooperation with the Provincial Armed Forces and the Traffic Police to inspect the tax for small and large vehicles. Stamp tax 2019 enters the state.
