(Kampong Speu): An unfortunate thing can already happen in Prey Tatrou village, Phnom Touch commune, Udong district, Kampong Speu province, by a 5-year-old military man named Hang Pich decided to file a lawsuit against his fiancé Legally engaged, there are elders as witnesses to pay the engagement fee, while the woman who is the fiancé went to marry the new man.
Mr. Hang Pich, who was holding an engagement photo with his fiancé, confirmed to Fresh News this morning, February 13, 2020, that during November 2019, he and his fiancé had a reunion with an adult. The engagement (engagement) at the woman's house was done in the traditional Khmer way and cost a lot of money to feed the guests in the village.
Mr. Khan Touch, the lawyer representing Mr. Hang Pich, said that the legal application for marriage law is usually left to the relevant parties for 15 days, and that the lawyer had applied in advance to stop the ceremony. This marriage.
The lawyer stated that his client's rights as a fiancée were equal to those of the couple, who were heard by the village elders, not to be engaged and equal to the girlfriends mentioned by the woman. The lawyer requested that the village and provincial authorities must strictly prohibit the marriage of the female party in accordance with the legal complaint of the male party.
