This bilateral meeting, as part of the Investment Conservation Mechanism, has been organized since 2009 under the framework of the Agreement between Cambodia and Japan on Liberalization, Promotion and Protection of Investment, signed by Samdech Techo PM and Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe on June 14, 2007.
