Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea expressed his deep gratitude to the Japanese investors who have always given high confidence to the Royal Government of Cambodia under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia to ensure peace and stability. Favorable investment policy and environment for investors of all nationalities operating in Cambodia is an indispensable factor before investors decide to invest in any country.
He also urged Japanese investors to pay more attention to the well-being of workers by launching and implementing new measures to prevent new respiratory viruses (coronavirus) in their production facilities. Maintain the normalization of the production chain to ensure the sustainability of workers' work and increase the business income of direct investors.
