Chip Mong Bank Baktouk Branch is located on the first floor of Chip Mong Baktouk Commercial Building, 174 Czech Republic Blvd, Sangkat Veal Vong, Khan 7 Makara, Phnom Penh, and Chip Mong Bank Noromol Branch is located on the ground floor of Noromol Shopping Center. Along Norodom Blvd., corner of Street 360, Village 8, Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang I, Khan Boeung Keng Kang, Phnom Penh.
