Prudential and ACLEDA Celebrate 7 Years of Partnership and Joint Growth
(Phnom Penh): The management of Prudential Cambodia and the management of ACLEDA Bank have gathered to celebrate the 7th anniversary of the strategic partnership through which we, the Cambodian people, can be protected with life insurance products. Prudential at all ACLEDA Bank branches throughout Cambodia.
The Dinner Gathering to Celebrate the 7th Anniversary was organized by Prudential at Sofitel Phnom Penh with the participation of senior executives from ACLEDA Bank, Prudential and officials from the Ministry of Economy and Finance And the National Bank of Cambodia over the weekend.
Since Prudential launched its operations in Cambodia in 2013, the partnership with ACLEDA Bank has been significant and has brought success to the company in distributing life insurance products and becoming a life insurance company. The largest in Cambodia as well.
Prudential Financial Advisory Group at ACLEDA Bank Branch is Prudential's most successful distribution network, and the same insurance products are offered by Independent Life Advisors at Prudential Branch directly in Phnom Penh. Phnom Penh, Battambang, Siem Reap and Kratie.
Since 2013, Prudential has had its permanent financial advisors at only 35 ACLEDA Bank branches. Prudential currently has 151 ACLEDA Bank Financial Advisors throughout Cambodia.
This strong partnership increased the distribution of insurance products by 18 times by mid-2019 compared to 2013. This is a good sign of a stronger partnership between ACLEDA Bank and Prudential, as well as the growing demand for life insurance services in the burgeoning Cambodian market.
David Nutman, CEO of Prudential Cambodia, said: “It is fair to say that our partnership with ACLEDA Bank is at the heart of the success of our business in Cambodia over the past seven years. This is why our company would not be as successful as it is today without the support of Dr. In Channy and his competent and professional team at ACLEDA Bank. ”
Mr. Heng Bo Makara, Deputy Director General of the National Bank of Cambodia, also said: "This partnership plays an important role in promoting the financial environment in line with the National Policy on Financial Environment 2019 to 2025". The National Bank of Cambodia and myself, I would like to congratulate all the Board of Directors, staff of ACLEDA Plc. And Prudential Cambodia for their achievements. ”
Speaking at the dinner, Dr. In Channy, President & CEO of ACLEDA Bank Plc., Thanked the Prudential staff and appreciated their professionalism and knowledge in distributing protected and savings insurance products. A new product for the Cambodian people yet.
