Mr. Khuong Sreng said this during a meeting with government officials at the opening ceremony of the new structure of Daun Penh district administration on February 12, 2020.
Mr. Khuong Sreng ordered the Daun Penh district governor to eliminate all kinds of gambling, theft, gangs, public order, sanitation, garbage, etc., so that this district can keep clean and still receive the three-flower award. The most beautiful city.
The Governor of Phnom Penh confirmed that it is necessary for Daun Penh district to be good and clean on a regular basis, because this district is the center of Phnom Penh, rich in tourist attractions that attract many tourists to visit.
