At the same time, Mr. Khuong Sreng reminded civil servants throughout the district as well as throughout the capital to improve the quality and efficiency of public services and local development to prevent all crimes in accordance with the policy of decentralization and deconcentration to address the challenges of Individuals at the local level with efficiency, transparency, accountability, environment and social equity.
