(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts calls on parents, guardians, relevant authorities at all levels, especially young people, to participate in disseminating, educating, explaining and reminding their children and grandchildren in order to use Valentine's Day in accordance with the beautiful tradition of Cambodia for honor. And its dignity, the family contributes to the promotion of the prestige of the society.
