In this context, the people, especially the young people of Cambodia, have been studied to gain an in-depth understanding of the traditional culture, which is the precious heritage of the Khmer ancestors, as well as to have a thorough understanding of the content and influence of the culture and traditions from outside to feed. Into the environment and context of its society in order to maintain the priority as a noble nation that is thousands of years old in Asia.
